Package: debscout
Architecture: all
Depends: apt (>= 1.6), ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: find the fastest up-to-date Debian mirrors for apt
 debscout tests Debian's official mirrors and CDNs from your own
 connection. It skips mirrors that are out of date, measures real
 download speed rather than ping time, and ranks the results.
 .
 It can then point apt at the fastest mirrors using apt's mirror list
 feature, so apt falls back to the next mirror automatically if one
 fails. Security updates only come from Debian's own hosts. Every change
 is backed up and can be undone with a single command.
